    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online function is now available</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/77d9ad69ac156268be1a540929c98fe0.avif?t=1751707957\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently you can connect via Steam or LAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to play together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Playertest version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playertest version is available for download. Come play with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to give any feedback about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introduction</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/ec5d22e30096a5aa081c66a59b07e883.avif?t=1751707957\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: Including melee weapons, long-range weapons, staff summons, and other weapons. Currently, it contains 43 common monsters and 5 bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/6f4b8dd985d920c08be7415b679333a5.avif?t=1751707957\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting: Plant various crops. Currently there are more than 10 plants that can be planted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/3c81e85540d2005ac87169d9ac06daf8.avif?t=1751707957\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Currently includes villages, forests, dungeons, oceans and other landforms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collection: Items dropped by monsters, collected items, mined items, and synthesized items are worth collecting. There are currently 230 items of various types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excavate: various types of ores of gold, silver, copper, and iron. Various types of weapons can be forged by mining various resources. It currently includes four categories of weapons: gold, silver, copper, and iron. And the corresponding four categories of suits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction: Build a camp to accommodate the arrival of NPCs. Currently, wooden houses, wooden tables, and wooden chairs can be built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like Terraria very much, you can try this game. It will also bring you a different experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online function is now available</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/77d9ad69ac156268be1a540929c98fe0.avif?t=1751707957\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently you can connect via Steam or LAN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friends to play together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the Playertest version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The playertest version is available for download. Come play with us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to give any feedback about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introduction</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/ec5d22e30096a5aa081c66a59b07e883.avif?t=1751707957\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat: Including melee weapons, long-range weapons, staff summons, and other weapons. Currently, it contains 43 common monsters and 5 bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/6f4b8dd985d920c08be7415b679333a5.avif?t=1751707957\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planting: Plant various crops. Currently there are more than 10 plants that can be planted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568620/extras/3c81e85540d2005ac87169d9ac06daf8.avif?t=1751707957\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration: Currently includes villages, forests, dungeons, oceans and other landforms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collection: Items dropped by monsters, collected items, mined items, and synthesized items are worth collecting. There are currently 230 items of various types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excavate: various types of ores of gold, silver, copper, and iron. Various types of weapons can be forged by mining various resources. It currently includes four categories of weapons: gold, silver, copper, and iron. And the corresponding four categories of suits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction: Build a camp to accommodate the arrival of NPCs. Currently, wooden houses, wooden tables, and wooden chairs can be built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like Terraria very much, you can try this game. It will also bring you a different experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dig, fight, collect, and explore. If you like Terraria very much, you can try this game. It will also give you a different experience.",
